	"description": [
		"This course offers an introductory, hands-on exploration of the integration of computer technology within the field of dance. Creative projects integrate improvisational and structured human movement experiences, dance for the camera, computer-generated movement, and digital video and sound editing. Historical and contemporary practices are introduced. Lab fee. Offered alternate years during Interim."
